484
01:23:55,908 --> 01:23:57,268
Tamam, tamam hocam. Sağ olun.

485
01:23:57,288 --> 01:24:01,087
Tamam. Peki. Arkadaşlar görüşmek üzere o zaman.

486
01:24:01,828 --> 01:24:06,728
See you later. Have a nice day. All of you.

487
01:24:11,828 --> 01:24:13,268
Siz de tek kerim arkadaşlar.
